  "description": "Kinney Mixte blends timeless style with everyday comfort in a lightweight, easy-to-mount frame that’s perfect for city streets, weekend rides, and everything in between. Its classic step-through Mixte design offers effortless on-and-off access, making it a great choice for riders who value convenience without sacrificing style. The newly redesigned wider handlebars create a more relaxed, natural grip that reduces strain on your hands and shoulders, keeping you comfortable on longer rides. Responsive aluminum V-brakes with reach-adjustable levers give you confident stopping power you can fine-tune to your preference, while the wider tires add stability and control over a variety of road surfaces. Built with more durable components, Kinney Mixte is designed to handle the demands of daily commuting and casual cruising alike. Paired with a smooth-shifting 7-speed drivetrain and an ergonomic comfort saddle, this bike makes every ride feel steady, secure, and effortlessly enjoyable.",
